    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but the fog is so cold. and everything is just so heavy. sitting at the edge... it feels like the only place where it wouldn't hurt to just let go of the weight. like everything would finally be quiet. do you think it's okay to just... stop? to not fight the fog anymore?",
